HolRefute provides counterexample generation for HOL4.  M1 supplies the
Quickcheck (QC) backend; the model-finding (MF) backend is planned for
M3--M4.

Module layout:

* Refute_Core: shared types, configuration, registry, and orchestration.
* Refute_Gen: generator derivation and enumeration support.
* Refute_QC: QC test planning and random/exhaustive execution.
* Refute_Cert: EVAL-based counterexample certification.
* Refute.sig and Refute.sml: the public API facade.

The refute_simp, refute_psimp, and refute_unfold theorem sets are defined
by the support theory and consumed by the M3 MF backend.
